# Principal
# --------------------
# No secrets to generate: maddy has no env-driven credentials.
# Submission logins are created by hand with "maddy creds create", see readme.md.

# MADDY_HOSTNAME/MADDY_DOMAIN have no sensible repo-wide default,
# they're this server's real mail hostname/domain,
# e.g. "mx1.example.com" / "example.com".
# Set them per host in that host's ".env" (Override section),
# same pattern as LINKACE_DOMAIN/PASSBOLT_DOMAIN.
